# Generate 3D in Simplified Chinese and Spanish (merge-0106-4b found it mostly English in zh-CN): the tabs, the
# service list, the hints, the remesh choices, Generate 3D model and Quick shapes all go through tr(). Product and
# model names stay English. The ImGui labels the panel shows are all translated: i18n_raw_labels fails on any that
# skips tr(); this is the screen check, at 1x.
run ui_look look=classic layout=classic
click "Preferences##palette.preferences"
click "Interface##preferences.interface"
click "简体中文##language.zh-CN"
click "偏好设置##palette.preferences"
drop ../../assets/demo/teddy-sketch.png
wait_for "生成 3D 模型" 5
expect_text 从图片
expect_text 完整 3D 模型（AI 重建）
expect_text Hunyuan3D 2.1 (Tencent) - 免费，无需令牌
expect_text 约 32768 个四边面，再加 1 个细分级别
expect_text 快速形状（离线）
expect_no_text From image
expect_no_text Generate 3D model
expect_no_text Quick shapes
expect_no_text Hugging Face - free models
shot zh-cn-generate-image
click "从文本"
wait 0.2
expect_text 文本转 3D（AI）
expect_no_text Describe one object
shot zh-cn-generate-text
click "从图片"

click "偏好设置##palette.preferences"
click "界面##preferences.interface"
click "Español##language.es"
click "Preferencias##palette.preferences"
wait 0.2
expect_text Desde imagen
expect_text Generar modelo 3D
expect_text Formas rápidas (sin conexión)
expect_no_text Quick shapes
shot es-generate-image

# Back to English for the next test.
click "Preferencias##palette.preferences"
click "Interfaz##preferences.interface"
click "English##language.en"
